+// height of its base, so it reaches the partner's back between its wrist and its knuckles: among
+// the oppositions / CMC flexions whose straight thumb passes over the partner, the MCP and IP
+// flexions that rest the pad on the partner's back (clear of it, and of the partner's thumb: the
+// same pose, so no crossed thumbs), nearest the partner's index knuckle with the least curl, the
+// way down from the straight thumb staying clear too. Returns false (fp unchanged) without one.
+template <class Dist>
+inline bool thumbOnto(const Skeleton& sk, FingerPose& fp, const mat4& partner, const Dist& dist) {
+    const mat4 toPartner = inverseAffine(partner);
